{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QT15TgqaHzEDc73UGTCYFU","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md has been updated successfully. (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"764317fa-ba6a-468d-853d-2d61b3563ec2","uuid":"f35f8170-0e99-4a68-8be4-4f8aaa7bc6cd","timestamp":"2026-06-11T14:29:32.053Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md","oldString":"- sos_1: the exile-instead replacement is one-shot (unregisters after applying)\n  since it binds to that cast of the spell, not the card forever.","newString":"- sos_1: the exile-instead replacement is one-shot (unregisters after applying)\n  since it binds to that cast of the spell, not the card forever.\n- sos_257: restricted mana in `ManaPool` supports exactly one restriction kind\n  (\"instant_or_sorcery\") — a deliberate card-local limitation. When allowed,\n  restricted mana is consumed before unrestricted mana (deterministic; always\n  at least as good for the player). `cast_spell` enables it for\n  instant/sorcery spells only; ability costs never use it.\n- sos_257: the {5} animation mutates in place and updates the\n  original-characteristics snapshot, since \"it becomes a creature\" has no\n  duration — the new identity is the permanent baseline.","originalFile":"# Key decisions log\n\n- E1: `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` is fired from **both** `cast_spell` and\n  `cast_spell_free` — a spell cast without paying its mana cost is still\n  \"cast\" per the rules (601.2), so casualty/pump triggers must see free\n  casts too. Copies via `copy_spell` correctly never fire it.\n- sos_1: `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was defined (and registered on by FDN cards)\n  but never fired anywhere — added the fire in `declare_attackers_step`, once\n  per declared attacker.\n- sos_1: `move_to_zone` only consulted replacement effects when leaving the\n  battlefield, so \"exile it instead\" couldn't reach a resolving spell. Extended\n  the gate to `from_zone == STACK` and added\n  `SpellPutIntoGraveyardReplacementEvent`, passed by `_resolve_spell` for\n  instants/sorceries. Limitation: fdn_48-style local `_counter_spell` moves the\n  countered card to the graveyard directly, bypassing replacements — a spell\n  countered while Archaic's exile-instead applies still goes to the graveyard.\n- sos_1: the exile-instead replacement is one-shot (unregisters after applying)\n  since it binds to that cast of the spell, not the card forever.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":16,"oldLines":3,"newStart":16,"newLines":11,"lines":["   countered while Archaic's exile-instead applies still goes to the graveyard."," - sos_1: the exile-instead replacement is one-shot (unregisters after applying)","   since it binds to that cast of the spell, not the card forever.","+- sos_257: restricted mana in `ManaPool` supports exactly one restriction kind","+  (\"instant_or_sorcery\") — a deliberate card-local limitation. When allowed,","+  restricted mana is consumed before unrestricted mana (deterministic; always","+  at least as good for the player). `cast_spell` enables it for","+  instant/sorcery spells only; ability costs never use it.","+- sos_257: the {5} animation mutates in place and updates the","+  original-characteristics snapshot, since \"it becomes a creature\" has no","+  duration — the new identity is the permanent baseline."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
