ered while Archaic's exile-instead applies still goes to the graveyard.\n- sos_1: the exile-instead replacement is one-shot (unregisters after applying)\n  since it binds to that cast of the spell, not the card forever.\n- sos_257: restricted mana in `ManaPool` supports exactly one restriction kind\n  (\"instant_or_sorcery\") — a deliberate card-local limitation. When allowed,\n  restricted mana is consumed before unrestricted mana (deterministic; always\n  at least as good for the player). `cast_spell` enables it for\n  instant/sorcery spells only; ability costs never use it.\n- sos_257: the {5} animation mutates in place and updates the\n  original-characteristics snapshot, since \"it becomes a creature\" has no\n  duration — the new identity is the permanent baseline.\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":21,"oldLines":6,"newStart":21,"newLines":12,"lines":["   restricted mana is consumed before unrestricted mana (deterministic; always","   at least as good for the player). `cast_spell` enables it for","   instant/sorcery spells only; ability costs never use it.","+- sos_57: \"mana spent to cast that spell\" = amount actually paid after cost","+  reductions — `cast_spell` now stamps `card.mana_spent = effective_cost.cmc`","+  (0 for free casts). The Wizard check happens when the delayed trigger fires","+  (per TODO), and the trigger is one-shot whether or not a Wizard was present.","+  Limitation: \"your next main phase\" = next *precombat* main (no","+  postcombat-main event exists in the engine)."," - sos_257: the {5} animation mutates in place and updates the","   original-characteristics snapshot, since \"it becomes a creature\" has no","   duration — the new identity is the permanent baseline."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
